{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L05hc3R5JTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Nasty","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xWNJW9YwB5Sbrbbscra3EZS9VP4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8aEQHFvRWZjsVryKc3h4LLuk1bi.jpg","description":"1972 was a turning point in Ilie Nastase's career: he won his first US Open, while also reaching both Wimbledon and Davis Cup finals. Moving back and forth in time and featuring amazing archive footage and exclusive interviews with top athletes, the documentary explores Nastase's highs and lows, the controversies that surrounded him and the enduring impact he has had on the world of tennis. Lovable, charming and generous, yet temperamental, arrogant and obscene, Mr. Nice'n'Nasty disrupted the old-fashioned etiquette of the sport in the 70s thus becoming its first rebel rock star.\n\nReleased 16 Apr 2024 · Romania · Language: English · 104 min\nStudio: Libra Film\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.6","runtime":"104 min","cast":["Ilie Năstase","Ion Țiriac","Jimmy Connors","Stan Smith","Björn Borg","John McEnroe","Billie Jean King","Rafael Nadal"],"director":["Cristian Pascariu","Tudor D. Popescu"],"released":"2024-04-16T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"More than just tennis","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Cristian Pascariu","character":"Director"},{"name":"Ilie Năstase","character":"Self - Winner of 2 Grand Slam Singles Titles","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x7zMOIZLGyqvwBuvldTcx0rCmIF.jpg"},{"name":"Ion Țiriac","character":"Self - Romanian Businessman, Doubles Grand Slam Winner"},{"name":"Jimmy Connors","character":"Self - Winner of 8 Grand Slam Singles Titles","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4IJFAzVuOEi21wMuddqFs82Blg8.jpg"},{"name":"Stan Smith","character":"Self - Winner of 2 Grand Slam Singles Titles"},{"name":"Björn Borg","character":"Self - Winner of 11 Grand Slam Singl